  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 312.01 Purpose and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 312.01 Purpose and Applicability.\n\n(a) The rules in this part specify the provisions for obtaining a research and development facility permit.\n\n(b) A research and development facility permit shall apply to research and development projects, as defined in Env-Sw 104, except no permit shall be required for research and development facilities identified in Env-Sw 302.03(b)(7).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
